<title>USA: TABLE-Consolidated Stores June sales higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Consolidated Stores June sales higher.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, OHIO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four weeks ended June 28</p>
<p>							    Comparable</p>
<p>		 Retail Sales ($ in millions)     Store Sales</p>
<p>Period	   1997	1996*   Change    1997  1996*</p>
<p>June	    $194.4    $164.1    18.5%    11.4%    4.3%</p>
<p>Q2 to date    $380.4    $317.7    19.7%    12.0%    3.5%</p>
<p>Year to date  $963.7    $630.0    53.0%    10.5%    4.8%</p>
<p>* All 1996 periods have been restated to reflect continuing operations.</p>
<p>Consolidated operates 1,212 toy and toy close out stores and 644 close-out stores. Its operations include K-B Toys, K-B Toy Works, Odd Lots, and Big Lots.</p>
